# Acknowledging is the only way past a borrow, a hold or a return the proxy
# refuses to guess about, so every path is driven: the borrow that has no loan
# to sit against, the hold that has none either, then the return that has one.
clean
tap Library
wait-for My books
wait-for Needs your attention
tap Uncertain fixture title
wait-for Needs you
expect cannot tell whether Montréal gave you this
expect it borrows nothing and
expect stopped answering
expect I checked my account
clean
tap I checked my account
wait-for Cleared
# The loans and the unresolved list are read again after the acknowledgement,
# so the row goes on the answer to that read, not on this tap.
wait 2000
expect-missing Uncertain fixture title
tap Uncertain fixture hold
wait-for Needs you
expect cannot tell whether BAnQ put you in line
expect places no hold and cancels
expect I checked my account
clean
tap I checked my account
wait-for Cleared
wait 2000
expect-missing Uncertain fixture hold
# One library at a time: with nothing needing a person the page holds the
# loans, and the unconfirmed return is one of Montréal's.
tap Montréal
wait-for My books
tap Fixture uncertain return
wait-for Needs you
expect took this loan
expect I checked my account
tap I checked my account
wait-for Cleared
wait 2000
expect-missing Return not confirmed
clean
